<title>BANGLADESH: Bangladesh July M2 falls 0.15pct m/m,7.8pct up y/y.</title>
<headline>Bangladesh July M2 falls 0.15pct m/m,7.8pct up y/y.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bangladesh's M2 money supply fell 0.15 percent in July to 456.1 billion taka after rising 3.8 percent in June to 456.8, central bank officials said.</p>
<p>The year-on-year rise is 7.8 percent to July, 1996.</p>
<p>					 JULY    JUNE    JULY 1995</p>
<p>    M2 money supply (bln taka) 456.1   456.8   423.0</p>
<p>    M1 money supply (bln taka) 139.2   144.5   130.2</p>
</text>
